# Merged reverse proxy config for the HA Caddy pair
# Nodes: caddy 103 (pve-core, 192.168.1.42, prio 150) + caddy 101 (pve-gpu, 192.168.1.40, prio 100)
# Fronted by keepalived virtual IP 192.168.1.10. Deployed identically to both nodes.
# Captured from live configs 2026-08-06:
#   caddy 116 (pve-exu) *.pve.lan tree, caddy 101 (pve-gpu) *.lan tree, caddy 103 (pve-core) pi.lan
# Protocol behavior preserved from source: HTTP-only sites stay http://. TLS
# sites (openbao, pi, pve.lan) are issued by the single step-ca "Burney Home CA"
# (config/step-ca/root_ca.crt). Caddy validates via tls-alpn-01 on :443, which
# needs DNS to point those names at the VIP (done 2026-08-06).
# NEW: pve.lan -> Proxmox web UI (goal: all PVE services behind one front IP).

{
	acme_ca https://192.168.1.43:443/acme/acme/directory
	acme_ca_root /etc/caddy/root_ca.crt
}

